{"title":"Career Roadmap · Architectural Technologist","role":"Architectural Technologist","summary":"An Architectural Technologist sits at the intersection of architecture, building technology, digital design, BIM, computational design, materials, construction, and building performance.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Arch (Bachelor of Architecture)","Course":"Digital Architecture / Computational Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An Architectural Technologist sits at the intersection of architecture, building technology, digital design, BIM, computational design, materials, construction, and building performance."},{"type":"p","text":"The role focuses on translating architectural ideas into technically feasible, digitally coordinated, high-performance and buildable buildings."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technical architectural design"},{"text":"Building systems"},{"text":"Construction detailing"},{"text":"BIM"},{"text":"Computational design"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"Digital fabrication"},{"text":"Building performance"},{"text":"Material systems"},{"text":"Façade engineering coordination"},{"text":"Design-to-manufacturing workflows"},{"text":"Digital construction"},{"text":"Technical documentation"},{"text":"Multidisciplinary coordination"},{"text":"For a B.Arch graduate specializing in Digital Architecture / Computational Design, this is a strong technology-oriented career."}]},{"type":"p","text":"The ideal professional profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Architecture","Building Technology","BIM","Computational Design","Fabrication","Building Performance"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Arch + Digital Foundation"},{